//substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:640,&quot;width&quot;:480,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:80978,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngdD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F38d864bc-dde5-433d-9e92-51e8b4fe1936_480x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>这个公寓楼的电梯和过道上一直都有这个气味，而且我租房时看过的另一个公寓楼的过道里也充满了这种气味。看来有人周期性地在所有的公寓楼的电梯和过道里喷洒这种有毒的东西，应该不只是我偶然碰上的这两次。</p><p>英国人可能都以为这是正常的“消毒”，所以没有留意，但对于我来说很明显这是在“放毒”。为什么呢？想想普通的消毒水应该是怎么使用的？一般喷了消毒水在物体表面，都只会喷一点点，而且会马上擦干。</p><p>记得饭店服务员是怎么擦桌子的吗？在桌上喷了消毒水，马上用抹布擦干，而不会喷了就走。记得护士打针时是怎么给皮肤消毒的吗？棉球蘸一点酒精，擦一下，然后马上用干的棉球擦干，而不会让酒精就这样留在皮肤上。保洁人员也不会把消毒水喷了就走，而是会马上擦干。这些消毒水本身都是有毒的，不应该长时间接触人体，或弥漫在空气里，被吸入到肺里。</p><p>但是这些人在地板上喷了很多的消毒水，像是在用消毒水冲洗地面一样，而且喷了之后不擦干，任凭它留在地板上挥发。进进出出的人踩在消毒水上面，地板马上又粘上他们鞋底上的灰尘，弄得泥浆一样难看。这显然不是任何正常的保洁人员会做的事情。在英国这么讲究品味和干净的国家，就更不应该出现。</p><p>很多人也许认为这是保洁员没有接受正规的训练，但全英国所有的保洁员都这样，喷很多的消毒水，不擦干就走，这概率有多低？没人应该犯这样的“错误”。这不是错误，而是在故意放毒，是犯罪。</p><p>再综合我在《空气清新剂的噩梦》<a href=\"https://yinwang1.substack.com/p/206\">https://yinwang1.substack.com/p/206</a> 一文中记录的各种现象，到今天这一切都很清楚了——有人在英国所有的公共场所喷洒或悬挂这种有毒空气清新剂（消毒水）。Uber，Bolt，Black Cab，酒店，Airbnb，火车，飞机，甚至包括私人公寓楼都这样，这绝对不是偶然。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:640,&quot;width&quot;:480,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:87951,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!67E_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb5f4c283-487d-424a-921d-0d197faea05e_480x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>当你发现英国酒店喷洒的空气清新剂和消毒水的制造商 Ecolab，最大的股东是 Bill Gates，这一切就更加清楚了。很多人都知道，Bill Gates 在全球投资各种“疫苗研究”，表面上是做“慈善”，“帮助全人类”，而其实这些疫苗全都是毒药，它们在残害全人类。新冠疫情期间，各国政府都以“疫情”为借口，强迫或变相强迫人们注射有毒的疫苗，导致很多人突然离奇死亡，Bill Gates 在这其中显然处于举足轻重的位置。可以确信的是，Bill Gates 是 Matrix 的高级成员。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg\" width=\"640\" height=\"499\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:499,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:133176,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LUqn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f9e2169-b790-44bf-90fc-3d776ae28e3e_640x499.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>为什么 Bill Gates 会热衷于投资 Ecolab 这样的廉价保洁用品公司，成为它的最大股东，并且在疫情爆发前的 2018 年追加了 2.3 亿美元的投资？不觉得奇怪吗？这个品牌的空气清新剂和消毒水里面，到底加入了什么特别的化学物质，配合了 Matrix 残害全人类的目标？😄</p><p>所以我觉得这一切已经很清楚了，英国人的“新冠症状”一部分就是由这些空气清新剂或消毒水里面的有毒化学物质导致的。另外，地铁和泰晤士河边的“雾霾”，天上的化学尾迹，应该也同时有作用。其它国家应该也是类似的情况。所谓“新冠疫情”，是一场多种方式放毒的全球联合行动。人们应该清楚的认识到这个事情。</p>",
  "truncated_body_text": "今天早上起来出门，发现公寓楼的电梯和楼下出口处，地板都是湿的，覆盖着厚厚一层液体，空气里弥漫着浓烈的化学空气清新剂（消毒水）味道。在此之前还有一天，我也发现这样的情况。由于公寓的内走廊和防火门设计，完全阻止了空气流通，这个味道很不容易散掉。",
